{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"explainable ai explainable ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md","fileName":"Explainable AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Explainable AI","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Responsibility and Explainability]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Algorithmic Accountability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"explainable ai explainable ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.md","fileName":"Explainable AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Explainable AI","heading":"Explainable AI","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Explainable AI develops methods and practices that make an automated result intelligible to people. An explanation may identify influential evidence, describe the model's general logic, show why one outcome occurred instead of another, or state how human choices shaped the system.\n\nExplanation is not identical to complete technical disclosure. Different audiences need different answers, and a simplified explanation can mislead if it hides uncertainty or important limitations. Explainability may also trade off against model performance in some designs. Ethical use asks what level of understanding is necessary for informed action, challenge, and [[Algorithmic Accountability]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Algorithmic Accountability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Explainable AI.m